@startuml
title 图4-10 AI对话模块交互时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "微信小程序" as MiniApp
participant "AppAIController" as AC
participant "AdminAssistantService" as SVC
participant "IClGoodsService" as Goods
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Ollama\n(LLM)" as LLM

User -> MiniApp : 输入问题/春联需求
MiniApp -> AC : POST /api/app/ai/chat\ndevice_id + question
AC -> SVC : chat(request)
SVC -> Goods : getRecommendedGoods(...)
Goods -> DB : 检索商品/热门
Goods --> SVC : 候选商品列表
SVC -> LLM : HTTP 调用生成回答
LLM --> SVC : 模型输出文本
SVC -> DB : 写入 cl_ai_chat_log\n(question, answer, recommended_goods)
SVC --> AC : ChatResultVO
AC --> MiniApp : {code:200, data}
MiniApp -> MiniApp : getChatHistory（可选）
MiniApp --> User : 展示回复与推荐商品

@enduml
